{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"蒙古国","country_iso":"MNG","created_at":"2026-03-23T11:10:02.394790","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MNG-HB-0002","ldc":"No","location":"乌兰巴托","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"蒙古国乌兰巴托阿么格楞116MW供热站扩建项目","project_name_en":"Mongolia Ulaanbaatar Amoglong 116MW Heating Station Expansion Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"湖南安装海外工程公司","content":"▲蒙古国总理奥云额尔登致辞\n近日，蒙古国阿么格楞116MW供热站扩建项目奠基仪式在蒙古国首都乌兰巴托市阿么格楞供热站举行。\n蒙古国总理奥云额尔登、蒙古国能源部部长塔宾贝赫、阿么格楞供热站厂长巴彦孟和等蒙古国政要和能源领域相关人员出席。\n2022年5月11日，海外工程公司顺利中标蒙古国阿么格楞116MW供热站扩建项目，并于今年6月7日顺利签署EPC总承包合同，合同金额为656.89亿蒙图，约合人民币\n1.41亿元\n，项目资金的15%来自蒙古国政府自筹，85%来自蒙古国开发银行融资，工期为16个月。该项目建成后，将为居住在乌兰巴托巴彦祖尔和区30%的人口提供可靠的热源。\n▲我司员工与蒙古国能源部部长（左三）合影\n该项目是海外工程公司在蒙古国滚动经营承接的第四个工程项目，海外工程公司将持续为业主提供优质服务，推动蒙古国能源领域建设和当地民生改善，进一步扩大公司在当地的影响力。","content_sha256":"41c2d523ba1620011726c15d532ff8efb975e3a9b90c1fcf2ebcb06ade05deb5","id":16031,"publish_date":"2022-06-19 15:48:02","title":"蒙古国阿么格楞116MW供热站扩建项目开工！","title_sha256":"5b71dfc605e1f757c9c068c53c6e30ae8108790f62e69b4223e1164556c796c5","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/29457.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MNG-HB-0002","capacity_details":"Heating Station: 116MW","capacity_mw":116.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"116","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T11:10:02.396149","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"混合融资","financing_model_details":"蒙古国政府自筹15%，蒙古国开发银行融资85%","id":"MNG-HB-0002-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://zlgj.chinalco.com.cn/ywycp/hwkf/yzdq/202401/t20240126_121355.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2022-06-07","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value